          "text": "Mental status examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Alert and oriented to person, place, and time. Speech normal in rate and volume, somewhat pressured when discussing work. Mood described as “exhausted and over it”; affect congruent, with brief tearfulness when describing feeling she is failing patients. Thought form coherent and logical. No delusions, hallucinations, or thought disorder observed. Insight good and judgment intact."
      }
